SUMMARY:Bull Creek Preserve + Swannanoa River Trails
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nWe'll start at the Bull Creek Pres
 erve\, across the street from Berea Baptist Church. Will do a half loop\, 
 counter clock-wise\, to the Bull Creek trail\, then down the Dam Pasture t
 rail to the Swannanoa River trails. We'll hike to where the trail falls in
 to a creek on the Warren Wilson campus and have our snack at the lower cam
 pus. Then it's a return on the river trails after which we'll complete the
  loop in the Bull Creek Preserve. Distance is appprox. 8 miles\, little el
 evation.\n\nNo dogs.\n\n**Parking:** Bull Creek Preserve **ACROSS THE STRE
 ET** from Berea Baptist Church\, 2578 Riceville Road. Parking is limited s
 o number of hikers is limited.\n\n**RELEASE OF LIABILITY:** The organizer 
 of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The function of 
 the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or participate
  in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to as
 sume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a r
 esult of\, and associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledge t
 hat you agree to the Meetup Terms of Service: [https://help.meetup.com/hc/
 en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854
 a4f586c82.](https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-o
 f-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316779050
 /
