SUMMARY:Bent Creek--Chestnut Cove  8 miles\, 1300' ascent
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Meeting Spot**: Hard Times Trail
 head\, Bent Creek (see directions below)\n**Description:** Good footing\, 
 mostly shaded. From Hard times trailhead hike around beautiful Lake Powata
 n\, Pine Tree loop to Explorer\, up to Chestnut Cove Overlook for a view a
 nd a snack break then\, down to Sleepy Gap and a circle back to the cars. 
 Type: Loop. Max elev: 4000'. Avg moving pace: 2.4 mph. Well behaved dogs o
 n a leash OK. Prompt 8:30 departure.\nI'll watch the weather and post a ca
 ncellation message by 7:00 AM if the forecast for rain is significant.\n**
 As usual\, there is the option of grabbing a beer and/or lunch after the h
 ike!**\n\n**COURTESY (Please abide!)**\n\n**Only sign up if you \\*truly\\
 * plan to come.** If you must cancel\, please change your status to "Not G
 oing" as soon as possible. Avoid dropping out within 24 hours of the hike 
 so wait-listers can have sufficient notice. And please please PLEASE don't
  be a no-show.\n\n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group event involves
  hiking and\, possibly\, transportation to and from the meetup site. Parti
 cipants are responsible for their own safety and affirm that they have the
  appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and supplies. Hi
 king may involve risks to oneself and property. Neither your hike organize
 r nor Asheville Hiking Group can assure your safety nor eliminate all risk
 s. Participants assume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\, or
  losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316803388
 /
