SUMMARY:Table Rock\; 7 miles
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nLength: 7 miles\nElevation gain: 2
 \,000'\nSpeed: 2-2.5mph average\nDifficultly: hard\n\nWe will meet at Tabl
 e Rock State Park in SC and hike the Table Rock trail. The total hike is a
 round 7 miles with 2\,000' elevation gain. Unfortunately almost all of tha
 t gain is in the first half of the hike.\n\nThere is a $6.00 per person fe
 e for Table Rock State Park\, cash only. Please be prepared.\n\nFeel free 
 to use the comment section to arrange car pools. I will be driving from Br
 evard. I also have a SC park parking pass\, so anyone who rides with me is
  covered for the park fee. I can take 4.\n\nDogs are welcome. I will have 
 my dog with me.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316785387
 /
